{"author":{"id":"609bf866d4a5d716c19faf5d617b3bf3de478230d29602d72aad5aa90a80466f"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791237856,"nonce":"g1/Cinz4JUU0zslyOoch7/otZb4=","title":"Card-marking write barrier, with page protection as the fallback for unaudited natives","message":"Follows ecc98cc. Minors track dirt per 32KB block through page protection, so a program that writes all over a large old heap rescans most of it every minor. A software card barrier makes a minor proportional to the stores.\n\nDecided (2026-10-05): cards in every store ash controls; a program that loads no HDLL, or only HDLLs marked barrier-aware, uses cards only; any other HDLL keeps today's page-protection mode for the run. C/Rust HDLLs write Haxe objects behind the GC's back, and only page protection sees those.\n\nPlan:\n1. Card table in std/src/gc.rs over the heap reservation, one byte per card (512B), exported base for compiled code; minors scan marked objects' parts within dirty cards; cards cleared after a collection.\n2. Barrier sites (inventory from the survey):\n   - interpreter: write_value_at (natives.rs), write_raw_kind (mod.rs), op_set_array (ops.rs) -- covers the opcode loop and the SSA walker;\n   - Cranelift codegen.rs: emit_field_set (HOBJ/HSTRUCT, HVIRTUAL), emit_mem_set (Mem, Array), SetEnumField, SetRef;\n   - LLVM objects.rs emit_air_field_set, memory.rs emit_air_mem_set / emit_air_set_ref, enums.rs emit_air_set_enum_field (AOT and wasm share these);\n   - runtime: hlp_write_dyn, hlp_dyn_setp, hlp_obj_set_field, hlp_dynobj_add_field, the map *set functions and their grow paths, hlp_array_blit, hlp_atomic_store_ptr.\n   Stores into fresh (young) objects need none.\n3. Mode choice at the first collection: cards unless a non-barrier-aware HDLL is loaded. A barrier-aware marker an HDLL can export.\n4. Verifier (ASH_GC_CARD_VERIFY): before a minor, scan every old object; any pointer to a young object whose card is clean is a missed barrier, reported with its address. Run conformance and the corpus under it on every engine.\n5. Measure on the NUC: ecc98cc's reproducer, the corpus, and the barrier's store cost.\n\nBonus: cards need no signal handler, so wasm and Windows could get minors.","files":null}]}